return {
    ["3纪元激活特效"] = "3rd Epoch Activation Effect",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Sharp Hunting Outfit\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎忘记了罗塞尔大帝……这是个扮演歌颂者的好机会。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They seem to have forgotten Emperor Roselle... This is a good opportunity to act as a Bard.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>我怀疑她对我……呃，产生了某种特殊的情愫。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers voice) </> I suspect she has... uh, developed some kind of special affection for me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>尖晶石？不是红宝石？"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> Spinel? Not a ruby?",
    ["<P_Heart>（让我看看，他双手抱头，下巴埋在膝盖里，像是在抗拒外界。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let me see, he is holding his head with both hands, chin buried in his knees, as if resisting the outside world.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>科林……首席他看到了吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> Colin... did the Chief see it?",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>秘宝简介</>\n1、秘宝分为<Highlight>世界冒险秘宝</>、<Highlight>以战养战秘宝</>、<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>，不同秘宝进度与奖励彼此独立。\n2、开启秘宝可获得对应装等的装备，<Highlight>世界冒险和以战养战秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>丰富的养成资源</>，<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>可交易的资源</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获得秘宝</>\n1、参与对应玩法可<Highlight>累积秘宝进度</>，秘宝进度满后可自动转化为获得对应类型的秘宝。\n2、35装等、45装等、55装等的秘宝进度转化秘宝有次数上限，最多<Highlight>10</>次，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>开启次数累计</>\n从周一开始时，每日新增并累积共享开启次数，直到下周一重置。若当周次数未使用，将会被清空。具体规则如下：\n1. 周一到周五每天新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数；\n2. 从开服第二周开始，周六到周日<Highlight>不限次</>；\n3. 开服首周的周五、周六、周日仍然会每日新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数。\n4. 已获得但未开启的秘宝在解锁新的秘宝后可手动进行丢弃。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活力消耗规则</>\n共享开启次数消耗的活力将随着非凡者已开启次数增加。具体规则如下：\n1-5次：消耗<Highlight>20</>活力；\n6-10次：消耗<Highlight>50</>活力；\n11-20次：消耗<Highlight>100</>活力；\n21-30次：消耗<Highlight>150</>活力；\n30次以后：消耗<Highlight>200</>活力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Beyonder's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality.",
    ["PVP护符"] = "PVP Charm",
    ["“审判官”布莱克挑战竞速"] = "'Inquisitor' Blake Speed Challenge",
    ["“枯干的蒲草没有歌,但它们还在唱,它们是在我胸中唱……”"] = "\"The withered reeds have no song, but they are still singing; they are singing in my chest...\"",
    ["　　购买人：艾德温·霍克斯男爵\n　　出售方：<Hide id=\"#157\">夜鸦收藏会</>\n　　交易物品：<Hide id=\"#157\">疑思之镜</>\n　　年代：距今约八百年\n　　已知效果：\n　　佩戴后，可短暂提升观察力与记忆能力。持有者能够注意到常人难以察觉的细节，发现环境中的异常信息、矛盾与隐藏线索。\n\n　          <Letter_Highlight> ————警告————</>                        \n　　长期使用后，可能出现以下症状：\n　　持续性的被窥视感。对自身记忆产生怀疑。认知混乱。偶尔察觉视野边缘出现并不存在的人影。\n　　本组织不对使用者产生的任何精神异常负责。若出现严重症状，请立即停止使用并销毁该物品。\n\n<Note_Normal_HW>它让我看到了一些本不该知道的事。</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>好像，有什么东西跟随它进入了宅邸。</>"] = "　　Purchaser: Baron Edwin Hawkes\n　　Seller: <Hide id=\"#157\">Night Raven Collection Society</>\n　　Item: <Hide id=\"#157\">Mirror of Suspicion</>\n　　Age: Approximately 800 years old\n　　Known Effects: \n　　After wearing, it can briefly enhance observation and memory. The holder can notice details that are difficult for ordinary people to perceive, discovering abnormal information, contradictions, and hidden clues in the environment.\n\n　          <Letter_Highlight> ————WARNING————</>                        \n　　After long-term use, the following symptoms may occur:\n　　A persistent feeling of being watched. Doubts about one's own memory. Cognitive confusion. Occasionally perceiving the presence of non-existent figures in the periphery of one's vision.\n　　This organization is not responsible for any mental abnormalities caused to the user. If severe symptoms appear, please stop using immediately and destroy this item.\n\n<Note_Normal_HW>It made me see some things I shouldn't have known.</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>It seems like something followed it into the mansion.</>",
